Source: pg-try-cast
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/Mazuco/pg_try_cast

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pg-try-cast
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-pg-try-cast
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Safe text conversion with fallback values for PostgreSQL
 pg_try_cast provides try_cast and try_convert functions that convert text
 to a requested PostgreSQL type and return a fallback on soft input errors.
